<title>UK: Spring Ram first half loss widens.</title>
<headline>Spring Ram first half loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 29</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		4.5 loss	     vs 3.5 loss</p>
<p> Pretax		     20.4 loss	    vs 17.3 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   167.8		  vs 143.4</p>
<p> Operating result	 7.1 loss	     vs 16.7 loss</p>
<p> Interest		   2.6 charge	   vs 0.6 charge</p>
<p> Tax			  nil		    vs 1.5</p>
<p> Net taxed		  20.4 loss	    vs 15.8 loss</p>
<p>Note - Spring Ram Corporation Plc said &quot;further improvement in the trading performance of each business during the second half of 1996 is sought as the restructuring work is completed.&quot; It took provision for loss on disposals of 10.7 million stg in the first half of 1996. It passed on the interim dividend.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
